  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "五世界战役的关卡动态变化，敌人组合丰富且Boss会持续进化",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "A five world campaign mode with dynamically changing levels and tons of enemy variation - including epic evolving bosses",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2105620/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "可替换飞船并配置升级牌组塑造每轮玩法，另有六种独立模式",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Alternate ships and configurable upgrade decks to mold your run with Three difficulty modes suited for all players, including a \"Revolution\" campaign mode for maximal challenge Six alternate game modes, like Classic, Gates and Assault",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2105620/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "手工攻击波、关卡和Boss被随机组合叠层，让胜负依赖临场技巧而非背板",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "With Sektori I wanted to create a shoot'em up where every run feels familiar, but is still completely unique. A game of skill, not memorization. The hand crafted attack waves, levels and even the bosses are combined, randomized and layered with the upgrade systems in a way that creates an interesting challenge for every run.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2105620/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
  "opinions": [
